{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>קוצים</b> — Four times here: קוצים כסוחים (Isaiah), באש יוצתו, ואל תזרעו אל קוצים, דועכו כאש קוצים. This is what the Sages said: 'If fire goes out, even of itself' — and that is באש יוצתו, which implies of themselves. 'And they multiply to consume his ניר' — and that is נירו לכם ניר ואל תזרעו אל קוצים. And there they interpreted it concerning the wicked — and that is דועכו כאש קוצים, which speaks of the wicked."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:14:03.297275355Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}